E AX3142 1500-field-effect-set.ax:14:15-21 field-effect-exceeded "the lambda performs Alloc, IO, and the field `Hook.run` declares `effect(pure)`" #"performs Alloc, IO" !"a call through `Hook.run` is charged what the field declares and nothing else, so everything stored in it has to keep that" ?"store a function that keeps the declaration, or declare the effect on the field with `;@axiom:effect(io)`"
E AX3143 1500-field-effect-set.ax:23:14-15 field-effect-unknown "the compiler can't show that the value stored in `Hook.run` keeps `effect(pure)`: it is the parameter `g`, which each caller chooses" #"effects unknown here" !"a call through `Hook.run` is charged what the field declares and nothing else, so a value whose effects can't be determined is refused rather than trusted" ?"store a named function or a lambda whose body the compiler can see, or build the record where the function is known"
